Signed on 9 February 2022 by Dieter Ahlbeck-Roe (Chief Operating Officer) for Korvane Cold Chain Sp. z o.o. and by Bart Wiegersma (Managing Director) for Thermaglide Reefer Units B.V.

*Margin note, S. Brandão, 11 February 2022: the Dutch template had a penalty of EUR 100,000 per breach; I got it down to EUR 50,000 by pointing out that Korvane's side is exposed through the Tidewalk API specification, which is a longer document and passes through more hands than their drawings do. Do not let the 2024 renewal discussions raise it again without asking me.*
